{"id":"89b88563124855ce","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-hyperimmune.md","title":"超免疫与超超免疫集合","display":"df-hyperimmune — 超免疫与超超免疫集合","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-hyperimmune","aliases":["20-df-hyperimmune"],"display":"df-hyperimmune — 超免疫与超超免疫集合","chapter":"5","section":"5.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 5.3.1(iii)","source_pdf_pages":[149],"source_printed_pages":[114],"depends_on":["[[20-df-finite-array]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-hyperimmune"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-hyperimmune</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hyperimmune — 超免疫与超超免疫集合"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 5.3.1(iii)"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>149</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>114</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"352368d98a9342b6\" href=\"?note=352368d98a9342b6\" title=\"20-df-finite-array\">20-df-finite-array</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"352368d98a9342b6\" href=\"?note=352368d98a9342b6\" title=\"20-df-finite-array\">20-df-finite-array</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyperimmune}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(B)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow |B|=\\omega\\land\n\\neg\\exists F\\ [\\operatorname{StrongArray}(F)\\land\\operatorname{Disjoint}(F)\\land\\forall n\\ F_n\\cap B\\ne\\varnothing],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Hyperhyperimmune}(B)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow |B|=\\omega\\land\n\\neg\\exists F\\ [\\operatorname{WeakArray}(F)\\land\\operatorname{Disjoint}(F)\\land\\forall n\\ F_n\\cap B\\ne\\varnothing].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyperimmune}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(B)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow |B|=\\omega\\land\n\\neg\\exists F\\ [\\operatorname{StrongArray}(F)\\land\\operatorname{Disjoint}(F)\\land\\forall n\\ F_n\\cap B\\ne\\varnothing],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Hyperhyperimmune}(B)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow |B|=\\omega\\land\n\\neg\\exists F\\ [\\operatorname{WeakArray}(F)\\land\\operatorname{Disjoint}(F)\\land\\forall n\\ F_n\\cap B\\ne\\varnothing].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>击中的是每列与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的交，不要求整列位于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>。这一差别正是它们比普通免疫更强的原因。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 5.3.1(iii)；印刷页 114；PDF 第 149 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-finite-array","status":"resolved","id":"352368d98a9342b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-array]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-array","status":"resolved","id":"352368d98a9342b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-array]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyperimmune}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(B)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow |B|=\\omega\\land\n\\neg\\exists F\\ [\\operatorname{StrongArray}(F)\\land\\operatorname{Disjoint}(F)\\land\\forall n\\ F_n\\cap B\\ne\\varnothing],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Hyperhyperimmune}(B)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow |B|=\\omega\\land\n\\neg\\exists F\\ [\\operatorname{WeakArray}(F)\\land\\operatorname{Disjoint}(F)\\land\\forall n\\ F_n\\cap B\\ne\\varnothing].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":1273,"backlinks":[{"id":"e1683dc500d8b948","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"},{"id":"76356b50167415cf","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"},{"id":"93cbfd6e6986f453","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-df-finite-array]]；see [[20-df-hyperimmune]]；see [[20-thm-generic-biimmune]]。"},{"id":"680f7bcce5dddc10","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune]]；see [[20-df-principal-function]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-finite-array]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-hyperimmune]] — 章 5；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-hyperimmune]]"}],"outgoing":["352368d98a9342b6"]}